6","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"移动语音-6","category":"移动","seq":6,"text":"山中一梦醒，人间几重秋。","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/066076AB32DB91000183337353634333736.mp3"},{"id":"064426AB32DB91000183334303835383737","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"移动语音-7","category":"移动","seq":7,"text":"红豆年年不结子……也罢，等得起。","hasText":true,"duration":5.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/064426AB32DB91000183334303835383737.mp3"},{"id":"068696AB32DB91000183238333039353336","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"移动语音-8","category":"移动","seq":8,"text":"碑上无字，碑下有根。被埋藏的名字，迟早都会破土的。","hasText":true,"duration":8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/068696AB32DB91000183238333039353336.mp3"},{"id":"060336AB32DBA1000183133363931333938","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"移动语音-9","category":"移动","seq":9,"text":"径山学子的泪，须在出山前流尽。","hasText":true,"duration":3.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/060336AB32DBA1000183133363931333938.mp3"},{"id":"064616AB32DBA1000183531313431313238","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"MVP语音-失败","category":"MVP","seq":null,"text":"比同死更难的，是独活。","hasText":true,"duration":3.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/064616AB32DBA1000183531313431313238.mp3"},{"id":"067786AB32DBA1000183133383333353935","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"MVP语音-胜利","category":"MVP","seq":null,"text":"故人若在，当共看这长安花。","hasText":true,"duration":3.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/067786AB32DBA1000183133383333353935.mp3"},{"id":"067716AB32DB71000183535303936333131","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|云缨）-S2_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"若论枪法，长安如今无人及你。但她手中那杆枪的分量，比你现在这把要重得多。","hasText":true,"duration":9.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/067716AB32DB71000183535303936333131.mp3"},{"id":"067386AB32DB61000183333393936303335","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|云缨）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"……你这么喜欢，不如续一出《云将军传奇》，也许更精彩。","hasText":true,"duration":6.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/067386AB32DB61000183333393936303335.mp3"},{"id":"064876AB32DB51000183736323835393733","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|弈星）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"心有不解，随时可上山来。一局棋，一个故事。","hasText":true,"duration":7.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/064876AB32DB51000183736323835393733.mp3"},{"id":"067326AB32DB71000183137363930353535","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|赵怀真）-S1_L1","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"径山的中秋节礼已悉数发放，有人特意替你打包了“最好吃的”。","hasText":true,"duration":6.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/067326AB32DB71000183137363930353535.mp3"},{"id":"065976AB32DB31000183132353336333431","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|孙权）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"江郡风味想来定然鲜美，只是麻绳捆得不紧，到了径山，只剩个篓子了。","hasText":true,"duration":7.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/065976AB32DB31000183132353336333431.mp3"},{"id":"067556AB32DB21000183135363539383737","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|司空震）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"世绩收复长城，首要之事便是开关通商。他用兵，是为了有一天不再动兵。","hasText":true,"duration":9.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/067556AB32DB21000183135363539383737.mp3"},{"id":"068816AB32DB41000183439353536393832","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|王昭君）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"许是这红豆树也通人意……如今再不忍结子。","hasText":true,"duration":6.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/068816AB32DB41000183439353536393832.mp3"},{"id":"062076AB32DB21000183635323532393139","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|苏烈）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"有时候，一死容易，独活尤难。","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/062076AB32DB21000183635323532393139.mp3"},{"id":"067326AB32DB51000183736373836303338","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|武则天）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"陛下圣明。臣久居径山，山中雾大，向来看不清城中风雨。","hasText":true,"duration":8.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/067326AB32DB51000183736373836303338.mp3"},{"id":"060776AB32DAE1000183136393937383730","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|花木兰）-S1_L1","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"我有一故人，名唤高怀汲。听说他的故乡金庭早已无人了。","hasText":true,"duration":7.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/060776AB32DAE1000183136393937383730.mp3"},{"id":"063166AB32DAD1000183133353131373230","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|狄仁杰）-S1_L1","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"怀英，你用径山所学，来问我径山的罪，你好大的胆子。","hasText":true,"duration":8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/063166AB32DAD1000183133353131373230.mp3"},{"id":"063406AB32DB11000183939303333323131","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|上官婉儿）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"藏书阁中尚存几卷旁批。上官仪人如其字，清正有骨，不肯随俗。","hasText":true,"duration":8.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/063406AB32DB11000183939303333323131.mp3"},{"id":"066316AB32DB01000183137363233313935","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|李白）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"朱雀门题诗……有趣。长安风流，代有其人。","hasText":true,"duration":8.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/066316AB32DB01000183137363233313935.mp3"},{"id":"061616AB32DAB1000183230323831363637","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S3_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"世绩自小就主意多，走到哪儿算到哪儿。","hasText":true,"duration":4.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/061616AB32DAB1000183230323831363637.mp3"},{"id":"068946AB32DAC1000183136373532373538","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S5_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"天下水脉相通。如今机关引水之法已成，我想，这水也带着他回家了。","hasText":true,"duration":8.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/068946AB32DAC1000183136373532373538.mp3"},{"id":"063786AB32DAB1000183538393434313537","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S4_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"昭君最怕冷了……不能把她独个儿留在那边。","hasText":true,"duration":4.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/063786AB32DAB1000183538393434313537.mp3"},{"id":"066616AB32DAC1000183131373235323630","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S6_L3","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"是吗，真好。……真好。","hasText":true,"duration":2.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/066616AB32DAC1000183131373235323630.mp3"},{"id":"068986AB32DAC1000183132353233373334","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S6_L1","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"原来他们最后，都走到了离家那么远的地方。","hasText":true,"duration":4.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/068986AB32DAC1000183132353233373334.mp3"},{"id":"066416AB32DAA1000183135393033313338","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S1_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"真是辛苦了。","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/066416AB32DAA1000183135393033313338.mp3"},{"id":"065646AB32DAA1000183138323132353939","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":"空山遗客","title":"相遇语音（友方-王维|程咬金）-S2_L2","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"难怪昭灵喜欢那里。","hasText":true,"duration":2.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1778/065646AB32DAA1000183138323132353939.mp3"},{"id":"067646AB32DA51000183636313136333739","heroId":"1778","skinId":"1779","skinName":